      "type": "multiple_choice",
      "prompt": "If temperature rises above an enzyme's optimum, activity often drops because the enzyme:",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": "Gains more substrate"
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": "Denatures"
